    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 Augmented Learning Hub Workflow\n\n**What's new vs the basic version:**\n\n1. **YouTube Transcript Fetching**\n   - Automatically extracts real transcript via Supadata API\n   - Agents get actual video content, not just the URL\n   - Requires: Supadata API key (free tier available at supadata.ai)\n\n2. **Web Search Tool (SerpAPI)**\n   - All 4 agents can search the web for real, current info\n   - Enriches summaries, notes, quiz answers with live facts\n   - Requires: SerpAPI key (free tier at serpapi.com)\n\n3. **Wikipedia Tool**\n   - Agents verify definitions and key terms before generating\n   - No API key needed — built into n8n\n\n**Webhook:** POST /webhook/learning-hub\n```json\n{\n  \"content\": \"text, YouTube URL, or base64\",\n  \"contentType\": \"text | youtube | pdf | image\",\n  \"language\": \"English\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 564,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "2a5dbacc-9a29-42cc-b9f2-f516b17dc74d",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Augmented Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1632,
        752
      ]
    },
